        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bashīke ba ng'wa Zelofehadi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalīho bashīke ba ng'wa Zelofehadi, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Hefeeli, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Gileadi, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Makili, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Manase, wa lūganda lo Manase ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yosefu; a bashīke benabo bitanagwa ba Mahala, Noa, Hogla, Milika, na Tīzīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwise lūmò bakiza a ha nyango gwa kwingīlīla ng'wiheema lya kwibilingīla, bīmīīla kū būtongi bo ng'wa Musa. Walīho nū ngabīji Elieza hamò na a banamhala, nī libità ī lyose. Būūhaya gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū sīswe wachīla kwitogolo, alīyo atalekile ng'wana ngosha; gwike ū wei walī atī ūmò wa balondeeji ba ng'wa Koola abo bakalya gwīnda ya kūngomela SEEBA; ū wei waacha kūlwa nguno ya būkenaagūji būngī nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī gīsī, nibūlī ī lina lya ng'wa sīswe līijmīīle gīko dūhū, shitange īkī walī atī na ng'wana ngosha? Twinhagi na a bise sabo, gīt'ūmo mulībinhīla a ba mu kaya ya ng'wise a bangī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa ūgūshisha ū mhayo gwabo kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe ū SEEBA ūng'wīla gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Īyo balīyīhaya a bashīke ba ng'wa Zelofehadi ya ng'hana. Shikwigelile ūbinhe nabo sabo, nabo bapandīke wingīji ū mu kaya ng'wa saabo; binhagi ū wingījibo ng'wa saabo, būbize wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo a Baisilaeli bawīlage gīkī, ‘Ūlū munhū ūcha alīyo atalekile ng'wana ngosha, ū wingīji wakwe ng'winhagi nshīke wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū atī na ng'wana nkīma, ū wingīji wakwe ng'winhagi ng'wana wa ng'wawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū atī na ng'wana wa ng'wawe, binhagi bakūlūye nūūlū bazunaye ba ng'wa ise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ise ūlū walī atī na baana ba ng'wawe, ng'winhagi ndūgūye ose ose, wa bbihī ū mu lūganda lo ng'wawe, ū wingīji wenūbo būbize wakwe. Ī shenīshi shikūbiza shilagīlo sha Baisilaeli ū mu kaīle kaabo, gīt'ūmo SEEBA akanagīīla Musa.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoshwa ha nīmo go ng'wa Musa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa, “Linhaga ū mu lūgūlū lwa Abalimu ūlū, wīlole ī sī īyo naabinhile a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūmala ū kwībona nū bebe ūkūtwalwa kū banhū bako, gīt'ūmo nkūlūyo Alooni akīītīlwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno a bing'we būbīlī wing'we mukaleka ū kūshishikīlī ī shilagīlo shane, aho bakagoma a banhū ng'witogolo lya Zini kūlwa nguno ya minzī. Mutaninhile ikūjo ū kū būtongi wabo, īlo līnigeleelilwe kūlwa wela wane.” (A minzī ayo gahayiagwa, gaalī a ga Meliba ū ng'witogolo lya Zini.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa ūng'wīla ū SEEBA gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū SEEBA Mulungu wa myoyo ya banhū bose ni asolage munhū abize ntaale wabo a banhū benaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munhū wa kūshimīza hamò nabo, na wa kūbatongeela ng'wikanza lya kūfuma nūūlū lya kwingīla. Ū mu gīko a banhū ba ng'wa SEEBA batūbiza gītī ng'holo jitī na ndīīmi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa, “Nsolage ū Yoshwa, ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nuni, ūntūūlīle nkono gwako; nguno ū munhū ng'wenūyo alī na nguzu ja ng'wa Moyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wenhage ūng'wīmīlīje kū būtongi bo ng'wa Elieza ū ngabīji, mu miso ga banhū bose; hūna ūntūūle a ha nīmo gwenūyo mu būtongi wa banhū bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkūng'winha nag'hwe ū būdūla ūbo ūlīnabo bebe; nang'hwe bayūng'wigwa a Baisilaeli a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū alī na mhayo gwa kūbūūja kūlī SEEBA, akūyūgunanhwa na ngabīji Elieza; hū ng'wene akūyūmūūgīja mu nzīla ya Ulimu. Ū wei hamò na a Baisilaeli a bose bakwīta yose kūlwa shilagīlo shakwe; ūlū ūlagīla bafume bakūfuma, ūlū ūlagīla bashoke bakūshoka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa wīta ng'hana gīt'ūmo SEEBA akanagīīlīla; ūnsola ū Yoshwa, ūng'wīmīlīja kū būtongi wa ngabīji Elieza, na a Baisilaeli a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūntūūlīla makono gakwe, ūntūūla a ha nīmo gīt'ūmo SEEBA akalagīīlīla mu nzīla yakwe ū Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
